BlitzArt Linux (based on Artix Linux) -- text-only live session

To install BlitzArt to a disk, run:
    sudo blitzinstall

The installed system comes with the full Hyprland desktop (sddm, pipewire),
btrfs + snapper snapshots in the GRUB menu, zram swap and the blitz toolbox.
The toolbox is also available here: blitz (try: blitz help)
